information for purposes including organizing and making available=20
Professional Profiles and Business Profiles to our customers for their=20
direct marketing, sales, and/or recruiting activities via our products=20
and services, or to customers who sublicense such data to their=20
customers for any of the same purposes; testing, developing, improving,=20
and enhancing our products and services; and for our own direct=20
marketing, sales and recruiting purposes. Profile information is=20
provided to our customers or partners subject to restrictive license=20
agreements that limit the use to those specified purposes and prohibits=20
the unauthorized use or transfer of the information. Certain limited=20
Personal Information in Professional Profiles may also be made publicly=20
available in our directory pages portion of our website (" Directory=20
Pages "). The types of Personal Information that may be made publicly=20
