history, professional affiliations, and/or web references. Direct=20
contact information, such as direct phone line, mobile number, or email=20
addresses, are not provided in Directory Pages. Lawful Basis ZoomInfo's=20
processing of your Personal Information is normally based on the=20
legitimate interest of itself and its customers and partners to engage=20
in direct marketing, sales, and recruiting activities, and ZoomInfo's=20
legitimate interests in organizing and making available Professional and=20
Business Profiles, given the limited impact that this use of this=20
business contact and similar information presents to an individual's=20
private life. We may also rely on other legal bases in certain=20
situations, including for performance of a contract with you, as=20
necessary for compliance with a legal obligation, or consent, as=20
applicable. Categories of Recipients This Personal Information may be=20
provided, subject to restrictive license agreements, to ZoomInfo's=20
customers, its partners, or the customers of its partners. These=20
recipients are business organizations who are permitted to use the=20
information only for lawful sales, marketing, and recruiting purposes.=20
